Birdie model files

perch_v2_int8.tflite
  Google Perch 2.0 bird vocalization classifier (Kaggle: google/bird-vocalization-classifier,
  variant perch_v2_cpu), Copyright Google LLC, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  Modified: converted from the TensorFlow SavedModel to TensorFlow Lite with dynamic-range
  int8 weight quantization. No retraining; outputs match the original model's top-1 on our
  test windows.

sound_labels.json
  Bird classes of the model matched to GBIF taxonomy, common names from Wikidata (CC0) and
  per-country record counts from GBIF.org occurrence data (CC0 and CC BY 4.0 records only).
